  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Government Debt and Infrastructure Finance - Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A full time resident advisor will work to strengthen the Government of Brazils Investment Partnership Program as well as provide support to the Ministry of Transport where many of the infrastructure projects originate. Within the Ministry of Transport, the project seeks to address large scale infrastructure projects such as ports, highways and railways. It also will focus on expanding investment and employment to stimulate technical development, ensure expansion and quality of public infrastructure, promote fair competition, ensure legal stability, and strengthen the regulatory role of the state.</narrative>
  </description>
